    <p class="sub only-day">
      This page doesn't exist. It was last seen heading east with
      <span class="mono">payroll_2019.csv</span>. Site security is handled by Kaju, a labrador.
    </p>
    <p class="sub only-night">
      He lives on another continent, naps eighteen hours a day, and still caught you
      poking around. Incident logged as <span class="mono">suspicious_sniff</span>.
      This page does not exist, but you are now on his list.
    </p>
    <p class="threat only-night mono">THREAT LEVEL: tail wag · RESPONSE: ignored, then belly rub requested</p>

    <a class="back mono" href="/">← back to the pipeline</a>
